# Code

int main(void)
{
    const char *boundary = "---";
    return boundary[0] == '-' ? 0 : 1;
}

The fenced --- string above must not split the deck.

# Preformatted Text

make test
cmdf --deck --slide-numbers -x fade -o deck.html testdata/deck-corpus/comprehensive.md
open deck.html

Indented code should remain readable and should not participate in Markdown slide boundary parsing.

